ttom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:700">More on </span><span style="background-color:#e9eef6;color:#575b5f;font-weight:700">range()</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:700">&nbsp;(Official Python Docs):</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d"><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.google.com/search?q%3Dhttps://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/controlflow.html%2523the-range-function&amp;sa=D&amp;source=editors&amp;ust=1786364336137269&amp;usg=AOvVaw0wYSgN2q1vqnmUTlRR11Cv" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit">&nbsp;</a></span><span style="text-decoration-skip-ink:none;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;color:#0b57d0;text-decoration:underline"><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.google.com/search?q%3Dhttps://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/controlflow.html%2523the-range-function&amp;sa=D&amp;source=editors&amp;ust=1786364336137393&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Z_0b_b8IqCpbDjw5Rh5PV" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit">https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/controlflow.html#the-range-function</a></span></li></ul><hr><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><h2 id="h.jdybfbpk20qt" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:6pt;line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-size:17pt;font-weight:700">Week 3: </span><span style="background-color:#e9eef6;font-size:17pt;color:#575b5f;font-weight:700">while</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:17pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Loops and Indefinite Iteration</span></h2><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#1b1c1d">While a </span><span style="background-color:#e9eef6;color:#575b5f">for</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d">&nbsp;loop is for iterating over a known sequence, a </span><span style="background-color:#e9eef6;color:#575b5f;font-weight:700">while</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:700">&nbsp;loop</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d">&nbsp;is used to repeat a block of code </span><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:700">as long as a certain condition remains </span><span style="background-color:#e9eef6;color:#575b5f;font-weight:700">True</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">. This is "indefinite iteration" because you don't always know how many times it will run beforehand.</span></p><h3 id="h.kffeae5jk5r" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:6pt;line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-size:13pt;font-weight:700">The </span><span style="background-color:#e9eef6;font-size:13pt;color:#575b5f;font-weight:700">while</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Loop Structure</span></h3><ul class="lst-kix_y37211ak1kbi-0 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding-top:0pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:18pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:700">Structure:</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d">&nbsp;It starts with the </span><span style="background-color:#e9eef6;color:#575b5f">while</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d">&nbsp;keyword, followed by a condition and a colon </span><span style="background-color:#e9eef6;color:#575b5f">:</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d">. The indented block runs repeatedly until the condition becomes </span><span style="background-color:#e9eef6;color:#575b5f">False</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">.</span></li></ul><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:700">Analogy:</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d">&nbsp;A </span><span style="background-color:#e9eef6;color:#575b5f">while</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d">&nbsp;loop is like telling a child, "You can keep playing outside </span><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-style:italic">while</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d">&nbsp;the sun is up." The condition is </span><span style="background-color:#e9eef6;color:#575b5f">is_sun_up</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d">. Once that becomes </span><span style="background-color:#e9eef6;color:#575b5f">False</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">, the loop stops.</span></p><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:14pt;line-height:1.15;background-color:#f0f4f9;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#575b5f;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Python</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#5f6368;font-size:10.5pt"># A simple countdown</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#575b5f;font-size:10.5pt">count = </span><span style="color:#b55908;font-size:10.5pt">5</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#575b5f;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#8430ce;font-size:10.5pt">while</span><span style="color:#575b5f;font-size:10.5pt">&nbsp;count &gt; </span><span style="color:#b55908;font-size:10.5pt">0</span><span style="color:#575b5f;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">:</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#575b5f;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp; &nbsp; print(count)</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#575b5f;font-size:10.5pt">&nbsp; &nbsp; </span><span style="color:#5f6368;font-size:10.5pt"># IMPORTANT: You must change the variable inside the loop</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#575b5f;font-size:10.5pt">&nbsp; &nbsp; </span><span style="color:#5f6368;font-size:10.5pt"># so that the condition eventually becomes False.</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#575b5f;font-size:10.5pt">&nbsp; &nbsp; count = count - </span><span style="color:#b55908;font-size:10.5pt">1</span><span style="color:#575b5f;font-size:10.5pt">&nbsp;</span><span style="color:#5f6368;font-size:10.5pt"># or count -= 1</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#575b5f;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#575b5f;font-size:10.5pt">print(</span><span style="color:#188038;font-size:10.5pt">"Blast off!"</span><span style="color:#575b5f;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">)</span></p><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;background-color:#f0f4f9;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#575b5f;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><h3 id="h.mjug1ci7ix6a" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:6pt;line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;w