#e9eef6;color:#575b5f">curl -X POST -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"title": "New task from curl"}' http://127.0.0.1:5000/tasks</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">.</span></p><hr><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><h3 id="h.vrg6wa70bcv6" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:6pt;line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Further Research</span></h3><ul class="lst-kix_jab5669e3zdg-0 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding-top:0pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:18pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:700">Building a Basic API with Flask (Real Python):</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d"><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://realpython.com/flask-connexion-rest-api/&amp;sa=D&amp;source=editors&amp;ust=1786364336267971&amp;usg=AOvVaw0wYlqAAjFnjLdicbdFZ0V6" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit">&nbsp;</a></span><span style="text-decoration-skip-ink:none;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;color:#0b57d0;text-decoration:underline"><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://realpython.com/flask-connexion-rest-api/&amp;sa=D&amp;source=editors&amp;ust=1786364336268101&amp;usg=AOvVaw08F1Oqwt7XSutO46648nf4" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit">https://realpython.com/flask-connexion-rest-api/</a></span><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;(This goes a step further with Connexion)</span></li><li style="padding-top:0pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:18pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:700">Postman (API Client):</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d"><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.postman.com/&amp;sa=D&amp;source=editors&amp;ust=1786364336268235&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Z9FFT9IQPqr-sJhSyjNnJ" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit">&nbsp;</a></span><span style="text-decoration-skip-ink:none;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;color:#0b57d0;text-decoration:underline"><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.postman.com/&amp;sa=D&amp;source=editors&amp;ust=1786364336268288&amp;usg=AOvVaw2QKqwo6wkw7wAuDEURREZx" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit">https://www.postman.com/</a></span><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;(An essential tool for API development.)</span></li></ul><hr><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><h2 id="h.45wxszlhqqhh" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:6pt;line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:17pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Week 7: Introduction to Databases with an ORM</span></h2><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#1b1c1d">Using a list for a database isn't sustainable. We need a real database. However, writing raw SQL strings in your Python code can be tedious and error-prone. An </span><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:700">ORM (Object-Relational Mapper)</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;solves this by acting as a translator.</span></p><h3 id="h.658zz28p57nc" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:6pt;line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">What is an ORM?</span></h3><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:6pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#1b1c1d">An ORM lets you interact with your database using familiar Python objects and methods. You define your database tables as Python classes (called </span><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:700">Models</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">), and the ORM translates your actions on those objects into SQL commands.</span></p><ul class="lst-kix_ee1f6hpxrn1m-0 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding-top:0pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:18pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:700">Analogy:</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d">&nbsp;An ORM is like a diplomat üßë‚Äçüíº who speaks both Python and SQL fluently. You tell the diplomat what you want in Python ("get me the user named Alice"), and they handle the negotiation and translation to SQL (</span><span style="background-color:#e9eef6;color:#575b5f">SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = 'alice'</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">) for you.</span></li></ul><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#1b1c1d">The most popular ORM used with Flask is </span><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:700">SQLAlchemy</span><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">.</span></p><h3 id="h.aga2sqz3skeo" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:6pt;line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#1b1c1d;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Setting up SQLAlchemy with Flask</span></h3><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Ari