:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#5f6368;font-size:10.5pt"># ... (SQLAlchemy setup and Task model from Week 7) ...</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#575b5f;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#5f6368;font-size:10.5pt"># GET /tasks - Get all tasks from the DB</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#1967d2;font-size:10.5pt">@app.route(</span><span style="color:#188038;font-size:10.5pt">'/tasks'</span><span style="color:#1967d2;font-size:10.5pt">, methods=[</span><span style="color:#188038;font-size:10.5pt">'GET'</span><span style="color:#1967d2;font-size:10.5pt">])</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#8430ce;font-size:10.5pt">def</span><span style="color:#575b5f;font-size:10.5pt">&nbsp;</span><span style="color:#996900;font-size:10.5pt">get_tasks</span><span style="color:#575b5f;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">():</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#575b5f;font-size:10.5pt">&nbsp; &nbsp; </span><span style="color:#5f6368;font-size:10.5pt"># The ORM translates this to "SELECT * FROM task"</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;A